  TypeName: SumBlock
  BlockInformation: '<b>Sum Blocks</b>(<sprite index=4>,<sprite index=5>) can be
    placed on top of <b>Puzzle Blocks</b> (<sprite index=1>,<sprite index=2>) or
    on top of other <b>Sum Blocks</b>.


    When placed on <b>Puzzle Blocks</b>,
    the <b>Sum Block</b> will increase their value by the displayed amount.'
